<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="line-height:107%">Good morning/afternoon,</span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%">Please be advised that due to our Extreme Weather policy, your pet’s reservation for the DD MMM with AWB .081-xxxxxxxx, requires to be rescheduled.</span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%">Our policy is implemented to ensure the safety and well-being of your pets. Qantas Freight refrains from transporting any animals when the expected temperature exceeds 35°C or drops below 5°C. In such cases. You have the option to reschedule your pet's flight at no additional cost.</span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%">You can reschedule your pet's flight up to 24 hours before departure by visiting the "Manage Booking" section. If it's within 24 hours of departure, please call us at 13 12 13.</span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%">We appreciate your understanding, and if you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to us.</span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</body>
